## Acceptance

To receive rights under this license, you must agree to its terms. The limits on who may copy the Work, for what purpose, and on distribution and derivative works are conditions of the copyright grant. Copying outside those limits is not licensed by this document.

## Definitions

**Licensor** means Warfare Command.

**Work** means the code, content, designs, and documentation that Licensor expressly offers under this license. It may include Muster Out, Leader's Notebook, Watch Officer, FITREP Desk, and warfarecommand.com site content. Separately licensed material remains under its own terms.

**Individual** means a natural person acting for themselves. **You** means that Individual. An entity does not become an Individual by acting through an employee, officer, owner, agent, or contractor.

**Organization** means any entity or organized group other than an Individual acting for themselves. This includes governments at every level; their agencies, armed services, commands, units, and instrumentalities; the United States Marine Corps; nonappropriated fund instrumentalities, including MCCS; contractors and subcontractors; nonprofits; schools; associations; companies; and sole proprietorships acting as businesses.

**Your Organization** includes an Organization you work for and any Organization that controls it, is controlled by it, or is under common control with it. **Control** means ownership of substantially all assets or the power to direct management and policies through voting, contract, or otherwise. Control may be direct or indirect.

## Individual Use

**Personal and professional use**, called **Individual Use**, means your voluntary use for your own personal activities or your own work. You must choose the Work on your own initiative. Copies must stay on devices and accounts you personally own or subscribe to and control, including your own AI account, subject to the setup, completed-output, and GitHub permissions below.

Individual Use includes a leader using the Work to prepare their own work for the Marines they personally lead. Employment, pay for your regular duties, and an Organization's incidental benefit from that work do not alone make this Organizational Use. This exception does not permit copies made to fulfill an Organization's software requirement or deployment.

Copies made to prepare, perform, or deliver services that you or an Organization sells or supplies to a client are Organizational Use, whether the client pays you directly or pays an Organization, and whether you are paid a salary, wages, or a fee. This includes copies made by a contractor employee to perform a customer contract. Your independent personal study, career planning, or preparation of your own employment records may still qualify as Individual Use. An Organization's provision of services does not by itself exclude unrelated Individual Use. A military leader's independent preparation of their own work for Marines they personally lead is not client-service delivery merely because the leader receives government pay.

Copies made for use required, directed, procured, funded, reimbursed, deployed, hosted, or integrated by an Organization are outside Individual Use, subject to the express provider and completed-output permissions in this license. An account or device owned or administered by an Organization is outside Individual Use. A personally selected hosting or AI provider's necessary processing is permitted only under the setup exception below.

You may tell others about the Work and link to Licensor's official source. Each person must independently choose their own Individual Use. A requirement or direction from a leader, unit, employer, or contractor is Organizational Use even if each person installs a separate copy on a personal account.

A recommendation is not independent selection if use of the Work is made a condition of completing an assigned task, participating in a program, receiving an evaluation, or obtaining a benefit, or if personnel are otherwise expected to install it as part of a unit or employer deployment. A leader may require an output without requiring this Work as the means of preparing it.

## Copyright License and Setup Exception

Licensor grants you a free, worldwide, nonexclusive copyright license to download, copy, install, run, and privately display or perform the Work solely for Individual Use. No distribution or derivative works are licensed except the setup copies and adaptations and completed outputs expressly permitted here and the separate GitHub rights below.

You may make the copies needed to fetch official files by raw URL, verify hashes, install them on your own devices, load them into your own AI account, and keep private backups. You may transmit the Work to a provider solely to store or process your permitted Individual Use in your personal account. Licensor directly permits that provider to make the copies technically necessary for that storage and processing, subject to those limits. This is not a sublicense from you. Neither you nor the provider receives permission for independent reuse, model training, shared access, organizational deployment, or resale. Use a provider and account configuration that do not require you to grant those additional rights in the Work. This paragraph does not alter separate permissions Licensor has itself granted to a provider, including the separate GitHub permissions preserved below.

You may enter your own data and change settings or fill designated fields through the Work's intended setup and operation. This limited exception permits resulting setup adaptations. Apart from the completed-output permission below, it does not permit editing other code, instructions, designs, or content, or making other derivative works, even privately.

## Completed Outputs

You may prepare, reproduce, adapt, submit, and share completed outputs produced through permitted Individual Use, including outputs for Marines you personally lead. This permission includes portions of the Work that its intended operation incorporates into a completed output. It does not permit sharing source code, reusable instructions, an unfilled reusable template, or other material that allows the recipient to install, operate, or reuse the Work itself. Recipients, including Organizations, may receive, retain, and use those completed outputs for their intended purpose. Receiving, retaining, or using a completed output under this permission does not license the recipient to use the Work itself. No rights in your own data or independently created material are assigned to Licensor.

## No Redistribution or Organizational Copies

Except for the setup, completed-output, and GitHub exceptions, you may not distribute, publish, share, sublicense, sell, or otherwise supply modified or unmodified copies of the Work or its protected portions to anyone. A separate paid written license from Licensor is required for Organizational Use.

**Organizational Use** means copying or other acts requiring copyright permission by, for, or at the direction of an Organization, except the Individual Use, provider copies, and completed outputs expressly permitted above. It includes copies made to use, deploy, host, distribute, mandate, integrate, rebrand, resell, or perform client-service delivery. Copies made to satisfy an Organization's requirement to use the Work, or as part of its deployment of the Work, are outside the grant. An Organization's requirement to complete a task or produce a document does not alone make an individual's independent selection and use of the Work Organizational Use. Integration means placing the Work itself in an Organization's product, shared system, or prescribed software workflow. Receiving a permitted output prepared by an individual is not integration of the Work. These distinctions do not override the exclusion for client-service delivery.

